{"duration_api_ms": 71675, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "f7b67ee6-6328-4a72-b6ea-59ecd79c0fa1", "total_cost_usd": 0.0897695, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3955, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47440, "output_tokens": 596, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3955, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 499, "cache_read_input_tokens": 24388, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2619, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2619}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-sonnet-5-5": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 2456, "cacheReadInputTokens": 102529, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 11791, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.08199690000000001, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 16, "outputTokens": 5701, "cacheReadInputTokens": 173525, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 25482, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.007772600000000001, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 225, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "origin": {"kind": "task-notification", "producer": "session-task", "runId": "0mvb0htfo-2e70cdbd"}, "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 1}, "started_in_background": 1, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "Datasette startup now runs from `lifespan.startup`. The first-request path stays as a fallback for hosts that never send lifespan events. I read the diff against the spec and it matches. The spec's check passes: `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_lifespan.py tests/test_plugins.py` gives 157 passed, 4 skipped. I didn't run the wider test suite.\n\n- **`datasette/app.py`:**\n  - The new `_startup_sequence()` is lock-guarded and idempotent. It runs the immutable-database table-count precompute once, then `invoke_startup()`.\n  - `AsgiLifespan` and `AsgiRunOnFirstRequest` both call it in `app()`, in the original wrapping order.\n  - The local `setup_db` is gone.\n- **`datasette/utils/asgi.py`:**\n  - `AsgiLifespan` turns a startup or shutdown exception into `lifespan.startup.failed` or `lifespan.shutdown.failed` instead of letting it escape.\n  - `AsgiRunOnFirstRequest` now passes lifespan scopes straight through. For other scopes it takes a lock, re-checks, runs the hooks, and only then sets `_started`, so concurrent first requests wait for startup to finish.\n- **`datasette/cli.py`:** `serve` calls `_startup_sequence()` instead of `invoke_startup()`, and the comment says it is the same entry point the ASGI wrappers use.", "ttft_ms": 20576, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 28440, "uuid": "9413cc9b-7c6a-47ce-bd07-d44d76603c27", "ttft_stream_ms": 20110, "time_to_request_ms": 18, "first_content_frame_ms": 20110, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
